meta {
  name: Update - Status Toggle
  type: http
  seq: 7
}

patch {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/applied-jobs/PROPOSAL_UUID
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
  Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "status": "PENDING"
  }
}

docs {
  ## Update Applied Job — Status Toggle (DRAFT ↔ PENDING)

  Toggles the proposal status between DRAFT and PENDING.
  Replace `PROPOSAL_UUID` with a real proposal ID.

  - Use `"status": "PENDING"` to mark a DRAFT proposal as ready.
  - Use `"status": "DRAFT"` to revert a PENDING proposal for editing.

  ### Validation
  - Only "DRAFT" or "PENDING" are valid status values.
  - Any other value (e.g. "ACTIVE", "DECLINED") will be rejected with 400.

  ### Success Response (200)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Proposal updated successfully",
    "data": { ...proposal with updated status }
  }
  ```
}
